## A. High-level purpose

Build the **target userspace**: a minimal install of the *target* OS RPM stack
(dnf, rpm, util-linux, …) laid into `/var/lib/leapp/el{TARGET_MAJOR}userspace`,
so leapp can enter it as a container (nspawn/chroot) and run target binaries
(the real DNF upgrade transaction, dracut initramfs build). Bootstrapped inside a
writable **source overlay** (overlayfs over the running system) entered via
nspawn, then decoupled into its own directory.

Runs in **TargetTransactionFactsCollectionPhase** (tags `IPUWorkflowTag,
TargetTransactionFactsPhaseTag`). Effective order in phase: `createisorepofile`
(produces `CustomTargetRepositoryFile`) → **this actor** →
`convert/swapdistropackagesworkaround` (consumes our output).

